COMPILATION OF: E51B

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E51B

   1 a 0000 E51B:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-51/P1] LITERAL dividend, VARIABLE divisor: z = 1200 / b.
   4 a 0006      Constant in DE is the MB3 multiply form (LHLD var / LXI D,k /
   5 a 0006      CALL ?IM22N); DIV needs dividend DE = 1200 and divisor HL = b,
   6 a 0006      so H-B-de predicts LHLD b / LXI D,x'04B0 / CALL ?ID22N / SHLD
   7 a 0006      z.  H-B-stack: LXI H,1200 / PUSH H / LHLD b / POP D / ID22N.
   8 a 0006      H-B-conv: decimal pool conversion (the LR12 out-of-range
   9 a 0006      family).  A DR refusal is H-B-refuse. */
  10 c 0006   dcl a fixed, b fixed, c fixed, z fixed;
  11 c 0006   z = 1200 / b;
  12 a 0014 end E51B;

CODE SIZE = 0017
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 38AE
END  COMPILATION
